  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4c80964dec505111",
      "translationZh": "与 Google 共同创造时尚的未来",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ff987c1455f7a42",
      "translationZh": "两位时装设计师在 Google Flow 中创建了定制工具，帮助他们为纽约时装周进行布景设计和造型搭配。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e725958534c91b4f",
      "translationZh": "Envisioning Studio 用户体验设计师",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "你的浏览器不支持音频元素。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9396d34c840bf012",
      "translationZh": "此内容由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 尚处于实验阶段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19032a000052692a",
      "translationZh": "Google 的 Envisioning Studio 与设计师 Jane Wade 和 Sergio Hudson 合作，利用 Google Flow 简化时装制作流程。这些 AI 工具帮助 Jane 以虚拟方式搭配秀场造型，并让 Sergio 能够在严格的预算限制内将他的时装秀构想可视化。现在，你也可以在 Google Flow 中使用简单的语言构建自己的定制设计工具，无需编写代码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b43a10482221e5d",
      "translationZh": "摘要由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 尚处于实验阶段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bfd9e61866ad03b9",
      "translationZh": "《与 Google Flow 共同创造时尚的未来》探讨了 AI 如何帮助设计师更高效地工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0bbccdcce9e4f5d1",
      "translationZh": "Google Flow 帮助时装设计师减少花在后勤事务上的时间，把更多时间用于创作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "06d2cc1ad2f6b49a",
      "translationZh": "The Styling Suite 让设计师能够以虚拟方式搭配秀场造型，从而节省时间和材料。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f65f64f8fd4228f6",
      "translationZh": "Runway Visualization 帮助设计师在既定预算内规划时装秀和灯光。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2aaa78d1e0a82b1a",
      "translationZh": "你可以在 Google Flow 中构建自己的定制工具，无需任何编程技能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f344ef9188695765",
      "translationZh": "探索其他风格：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1b5cfdb11f983fbc",
      "translationZh": "问一位独立时装设计师，他们实际上把时间花在了什么事情上，答案很少会是“设计衣服”。行政事务、工厂物流和供应商协调占据了他们一天中的大部分时间，留给设计的时间少之又少。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ed5272aaaf4f469",
      "translationZh": "在纽约时装周到来之前，Google 的 Envisioning Studio 在 Google Labs 的支持下，着手精简创意工作流程，帮助设计师更顺畅地将雄心勃勃的秀场构想变为现实。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2b7db9e4ee1f88ca",
      "translationZh": "Google 工程师与设计师 Jane Wade 和 Sergio Hudson 并肩合作，使用我们的 AI 创意工作室 Google Flow，构建了两款专用工具，以应对他们各自面临的具体挑战。Jane 的 Google Flow 工具帮助她在制作实物样衣之前，打造从头到脚协调的整体造型。Sergio 则使用自己的工具，在工作室有限的预算内布置秀场。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "41985d23ee1dfa87",
      "translationZh": "以虚拟方式为服装系列打造造型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "13abc689f3250f67",
      "translationZh": "我们与 Jane 共同打造的 Google Flow 工具 Styling Suite，呈现了她的秀场模特造型的方方面面。现场模特选角和试装通常会占用设计团队多达整整三天的时间。这款工具让她能够为数字模特精心挑选发型、妆容、配饰、鞋履和服装，然后在虚拟环境中尝试不同的造型搭配。她能够在裁剪和缝制额外服装单品之前，平衡每套造型并找出缺失的元素。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe8bad4eb226f741",
      "translationZh": "Sergio 面临的主要挑战是在不超出预算的情况下筹办时装秀。过去，每当他要求制作团队调整灯光和道具时，都会增加总成本，因为每次设计修改都需要制作新的 3D 渲染图。我们共同开发的 Google Flow 工具 Runway Visualization，通过模拟他的秀场，省去了反复沟通的过程。它让他能够调整场地布置，并将灯光和道具替换为符合预算的选项。他还能够进一步优化模特的行走路线，让整场秀与观众体验更加协调。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5d06184021de6b48",
      "translationZh": "让时尚 AI 走出试点阶段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "94660c243421acca",
      "translationZh": "这些合作的成果已在纽约时装周的秀场上得到展现——而创新仍有更多空间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18ef91d1465f2b10",
      "translationZh": "尽管时尚行业对 AI 热情高涨，许多项目仍停留在理论测试阶段。通过共同开发适用于设计师现有流程、并确保他们牢牢掌握主导权的工具，AI 可以让设计师的制作过程更加顺畅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f81f3d7f46a3a669",
      "translationZh": "在 Google Flow 中打造你自己的专属工具，只需用自然语言描述你想创建的工具或工作流程，无需编程经验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ba07e0e30582b629",
      "translationZh": "在你的收件箱中获取 Google 的最新消息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1c2f6429af68386",
      "translationZh": "完成了。只差最后一步。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "177af4ad1775d8ae",
      "translationZh": "请查看收件箱，确认你的订阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ff091e7a47df15e",
      "translationZh": "你也可以使用一个 来订阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3070dbe5b762a2c7",
      "translationZh": "新专家加入 Google 的 AI 与经济团队",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64df1b9e4b2e1f94",
      "translationZh": "作者：Scott Strand 和 Zanna Iscenko",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4a889d2a4288b1f9",
      "translationZh": "让全球数据更易于探索",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b8839ff2bcf84e0e",
      "translationZh": "打造 AI，加速科学研究，改善人们的生活",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1e325ccb4c8fa6a6",
      "translationZh": "让每个人都能用自己的语言使用 AI",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3ee2da09177443f5",
      "translationZh": "来自 Google 的 AI & Economy ATLAS 的新洞见",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b61d0c87d68e301",
      "translationZh": "作者：Zanna Iscenko 与 Scott Strand",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ba2429d452d08347",
      "translationZh": "观看宇航员 Christina Koch 与 Google 的 James Manyika 探讨太空、技术与发现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
